      "content": "[https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_sukEMePc](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_sukEMePc) internal and external [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_sulL70vR](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_sulL70vR)\n\n**Internal auction**: Goods and services offered only by/for members.  \nMembers can be generous with their offerings and wise with their bidding. \n\n**External auction**: Goods and services offered to surrounding community.  \nEngagement with their silent auctions as well, for example through their fundraising events. \n\nAll auctions are silent. \n\n<columns>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n|||\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n|||\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n[https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suo0BIkP](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suo0BIkP) \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n|||\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSilent Auction Whale\n\n\n\n\n</columns>",
